# Vendored decent-player USB audio driver. Only the two build-required Android
# modules under libs/ are tracked; the nested repo's docs/driver/player dirs, its
# root metafiles, and the FLAC decoder module are excluded. Nested repo history
# is preserved in a git bundle (third_party/decent-player/.git was removed).
/third_party/decent-player/.git/
/third_party/decent-player/driver/
/third_party/decent-player/docs/
/third_party/decent-player/player/
/third_party/decent-player/libs/decent-media3-decoder-flac/
/third_party/decent-player/CONTRIBUTING.md
/third_party/decent-player/LICENSE
/third_party/decent-player/NOTICE.md
/third_party/decent-player/README.md
